#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md). NEGATIVE: this file is invalid.
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 4.8.4: a prototype may be instantiated in a file anywhere after the completion of the prototype
# definition. A prototype may not be instantiated inside its own implementation (recursive
# prototypes are illegal). Loop instantiates itself inside its own definition.
PROTO Loop [ ]
{
  Group { children [ Loop { } ] }
}
Loop { }
